 if(/prompt count|number of prompts|measure independen|work sample|data|progress monitor|rubric/.test(t))return [3,'Classroom teacher requests measurable follow-up','That gives us a starting point. Can we agree on how to record independent task initiation, the number of prompts, and written-work quality over several weeks?'];
